00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.330
We.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.639
I used the term earlier.

00:04:38.639 --> 00:04:40.300
We are reaping what we've sown.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:53.479
And that is exactly what you

00:04:53.479 --> 00:05:28.610
see

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:41.120
in

00:05:41.120 --> 00:06:40.320
this story.

